  <para style="h">2 Byitusu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Byitusu Baayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Byitusu</para>
  <para style="toc3">2By</para>
  <para style="mt1">Byitusu Baayi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Sima Byitusu, tnutnuyi jesnu Yeisu Kirisiti tnutnuloyi.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="2PE 1:1">Kwo lo da aza yi nu, dna n ɓəfyecezhni əyi Shekwoyi nya n Yeisu Kirisiti əyi gnyiyii, n ɓa kwu gaiciyaga ɓwa n kwo n apmayaakwoi n ɓwasnu ngye əyi nya.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Shebmyashi n bwugbafui ɓa kwu zhni əfye anya n mwamwai dna n ɓəyekpé əyi Shekwoyi nya n Yeisui əyi Dagayi.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əɓəgbmigbmi əwohni yiyi nya n knyiknyíi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Əwo zafnu kalá kwo kwu nyahonyahoi ga yi, n yi n əkwo apmai lo ntu anyìgyi shekwodnawo nya ɓo, ntu əyi əwo əye kpekpe ɓo, n wo ɓə yi əyi, fyi n əwohni latu ɓədo n əɓomanaizhnii nyi. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Fyi n aɓo ye nu, n wo kwu əwo aɓəgbeshi apmayaakwoda ga yi, nabai dna n əɓa nu n fye ɓa myi fya dnaɓwado dna n zafnu nyinyì, yii la waya n wnuwnuya, ń aɓəpwawo nukwoi ɓe n ɓai dna n anyì nyi.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ntu əɓəye ɓo n kwo nyi, fye la əfyehni yekpé fya ɓe əfye gaiciyaga əɓomanaizhni; jesnu əɓomanaizhni fya ɓe kwo ɓəyekpe; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />jesnu ɓəyekpe, a ɓe kwo tukwownashi; a ɓe tukwownashi, əmìfyi; a ɓe əmìfyi shekwodnawo; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />jesnu a ɓe shekwodnawo, aje aknawna; jesnu a ɓe aje aknawna, yeye wu. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Ntuge ndei n fye n alu yei lo njesnu ɓai mwamwaɓe fyi n əfye, ɓa ɓa kwnu fye ya n anyìgyi ntna-apma nya jesnu tnagyigyiga nya dna n əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti yekpé. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ama zahozahoyi n wo to n ɓai lo m, wo ta gyewyeba lo n kpaai m, jesnu wo zhni wyebwayi nu, wo la zamwi nge a ɓə zhna wo ya n əwo aleifyi akwokwoi nu.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Ntucenu əmi azaje n amapwii, fye la əfyehni mwakpe fya gbmi əfye yiyi əɓo n əfye knyiknyii. Ntuge n fya zhni aɓo ye, fye taa cebwonyi m. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Jesnu a ɓə gwo fye aɓwa-aba-aba fyi n əyi Dagayi n Gnyiyii Yeisu Kirisiti əbemi nyalonyalo nya.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sheɓəgwogna nyakagyigyiyi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ntulonu mi ɓa pa fye aɓo ye ɓo ciici, kwo shikwonyi fye kpe əɓa əye lo jesnu fye kwu myizhi kamkam fyi n gaiciyanunui n fye ncei lo nsaiye nyi. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Mi zhninubwo nge kwo bmyalo ma ce fye ɓəpá əsa n mi ye shnidnadna lo n lubwi nayi ye nya, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />ntuge mi kpəlo nge əsa taa mwa mii kpma kwo zhi m, shi əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti wo kwu kwo wu mi pəipəi nyi. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Ntucenu mi ɓaa əmihni mwakpe ma gye nge n əmi avnuzè, fye ɓə myi fya pa aɓo ye əɓo ciici.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Ntuge yi to ɓə vyi anabagyi azhnizhniyi aceceɓo nya nu, she yi ɓə da fye əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti ɓeɓe ɓo n kalái m, ama yi ɓə zhni aɓəgbmiyi nu əwo ikwodudui nya. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Wo ɓə la mwamwa gwo n latui n Shekwoyi Dada aba, she bəgye ɓə ɓe da wo kwoi gbmi n Latu Yaakwo, kwoi gna, “Əza ye nu zhni əmi Nugwnu, n mi ye wo, a da mi lo n woi zam.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Əyi n əyihni yi ɓə kwu bəgye ye wo n kwo ɓə gbmi n əshemi she yi ɓə kwnusnu n woi kpe n əpe gyigyiyi nyi.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Njesnu yi n sheɓəgwogna ɓədatnui lo n zhni ənya n kwo kwnukpema lo n zokwo dəhodəhoi. Njesnu kwo ɓa bmya fya kwu awyezewna n kwo, ngye bwuznagna n kwo fnu dna n wyegbma aba nya fyegyiɓwa, jesnu ngye kpasi n kwo kpé dna n əfye adu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Kpe n aɓo ye tukwo vnyanya, ɓəshishinu fya ɓwa awyega nge, sheɓəgwogna Nyakagyigyiyi nya to lo n kwo ɓə ɓe n sheɓəgwognayi əwohni bmapmyii nu m. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Ntuge sheɓəgwogna to lo n kwo ɓə pabye n zanyikwoci ɓəye m, ama sheɓəgwognayi, kwo shikwonyi ɓa ɓə zhni azanyikwoci nu, ɓa ɓə daɓo nu n kwo kwnu n Shekwoyi, shi Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə vyi n ɓai.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Anyawuyi akatayi n əɓa agbmazhnii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Shi sheaɓəgwognayi katái ɓəi fyi n aza atasni nyi, n ɓwasnu lo nu, a ɓə gye anyawuyi akatai n fyi n əfye atasni ce. Ɓa ɓə lo ɓe n nyawu atukwopmi ɓo agbmazhni nyai fyaa, ɓa ɓə la Dagayi duduyi aɓəna n wo ɓə si əɓa nyi; ɓai ɓe n agbmazhnii n pyepyei kpe n əɓahni. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Bəgyé ɓə vyi əɓa alu afyekwnu nya jesnu ɓai zhni ai ci gaiciyanunui zokwo wyegba. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Fyi n əɓa fnana, anyawuyi ye ɓə gyi fye fyi n anabagyi azhnizhniyi. Əɓa knyiznu kwo la mwasa tu n ɓa, jesnu əɓa agbmazhni too kpmaya n ɓa m.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ntuge ngye Shekwoyi to ɓə fa amaləka əsa n ɓa ɓə zhni leifyi ncei nyi m, ama wa tnu n ɓai fyi n anapyi, wa kwu ɓa fyi n agbma n wyegbmai, a kwu ɓa gwufyi ntu owada ɓo; <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />ngye wo to ɓə fa anyikwokwoi əsa n wo ɓə ɓe n nuwna akpmakwnui kpe n əkwo aza anukwoi m, ama wa gnyi Nuhu waazizhniyi ɓəfyecezhni nya, ɓədo n azajei ngwnu-tnaaba; <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />ngye wo ɓə kwu azhiyaakwo Sodom n Gwomwora nyai zhniagbma wa kpe ɓa əná ɓa kwu zè ətnu, jesnu wa kwu ɓa zhni ɓədogbe əɓo nya n kwo ɓə zhni aɓənukwoizhniyi; <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />njesnu ngye wo ɓə la Lotu ɓəfyeceyi gnyi, n wo ɓə gnyi n bwugbawnui ntu afyekwnuyi aɓəzhni tna-owaɓwashi nya ɓo nyi <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />(ntuge Lotu, ɓəfyeceyii n wo ɓə gyianyì dna n əɓa atasni fyegyifyegyi nyi, ɓə kwu gnyagwnugnya sni dna n əwo wyewyeyi ɓəfyeceyi ntu aɓəzhni tna-owaɓwashi nya ɓo, n wo ɓə gyewye jesnu woi wo nyi). <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ngye kwo lo nlonu, akpəge Dagayi kpəlo she wo ɓa gnyi shekwodnawoyi ya n mwumwu jesnu wa kwu atna-aɓəfyeceyi zhi ntu tata ɓo n owada nyipyei. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Nshnisnusnu dəye zhni gaiciya nu ntu n aza yi ɓo n ɓa vyi nayi aɓəpwawo wnuwnuya nyi jesnu ɓai ci ikwo wyegba. Atukwognakwoyi nu n agwui myimyii, ɓa ta wodna lo ɓa knyi ashemida akpmi m.<verse eid="2PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Kwo amaləka, kwo shikwonyi ɓa dulo n kala jesnu n ɓa dulo n ikwo, ɓa ta knyi əɓa pya akpmi əsa n ɓa ɓe n Dagayi owaznuyai kpe əɓa m. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ama aza ye, ɓa da atukwopmi ɓo fyi n aɓo n ɓa to n əɓa awyegai lo m. Ɓa wu ngye anyafwanya atna aɓonubwozhnii nu n ɓa to n tukwovnyii dnalo m, n a ɓə ɓwa mama ntuge ai wna a wu, ngye anyafwanya aje, əɓahni ce ɓa ɓə kwu fyí.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />A ɓə gba ɓa akpí əta n akpíi n ɓa kwu zhni. Əɓa awyega agbmadawo nya əkwo nu nge ɓa sni ənya laɓa n nyipyei zaizai. Ɓa zhni babala nu n cegyei, ɓai nyanya fyi n əɓa agbmada əsa n ɓa kwnu awyefna n fyei. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Əɓa awye n nunui n anagbáizhnii, ɓa ta fa leifyizhni ɓo m kpeekpe; ɓai wnu aza atnamyizhii ya; ɓa zhni agbada nu n fnana, aza n aknyii kpe. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ɓa la kwnu n zokwo cewoi jesnu ɓai ɓwu gbegbeya ɓai vyi Balaam zokwo Byeza nugwnu, n wo ɓə ye əkpí tnutnu gyiwye nyi. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Ama dokwo ɓə la gnaknyi wo ntu əwo ɓənukwoizhni ɓo; nyakpa n kwo ta daɓo m; kwa daɓo n zanyikwoci əshai kwa kwnù sheɓəgwognayi nyace.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Aza ye zhni anyaɓwo nu ntna nuwna, jesnu ɓwugye n agbmaase kwuya nyi. A n wyegbma ciciricii nu zhni gnyi ɓa. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Ɓa da əgbe gbəloi jesnu ɓai gyigbe, ɓai wu nayi shakpe aɓəwyeda, ɓai fyi aza ɓəpwawo n ɓa ye zhi ɓai ɓwa kwnukwnuya n aza yi akwnu n ɓa fyi n abaɓwi nyi. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Ɓa shi ɓa loloya ɓəgbe, ama əɓa n ɓahni ɓa zhni afyenu adu wnuwnuiya nya nu, ntuge “aza zhni nyahonyahoi fyenu nu n kwo zhni əɓa Dagayi.” <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ngye ɓa ɓə kwu pwo anyi wnuwnuya ntu əyi Dagayi n əyi Gnyignyii, Yeisu Kirisiti yekpé ɓo jesnu ai kwu ɓa je wnafyi n kwo, ai kwu ɓa gyisnu, ɓa la gna wnuwnuya n azozoba a fa ayayaba. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Kwo ɓə ɓaa ɓa du n ɓa to ɓə ɓa kpe ɓəfyecezhni zokwo ye m, a fa ədo n ɓa ɓə kwu kwo kpeye, ama ɓanyi pmyiavnu wu ɓəgbetu gyigyiyi n a ɓə la kwo dna ɓa n akwnu nyi. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Anyìɓəsisi ye zhni gaiciya nu kpe n ɓa, “əmwi kwo la jezelo əkwo atu,” jesnu “Bwurutumyi ń a la kwo fu nuwna, kwo la jezelo aɓwoshni.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nyipyei Dagayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Əmi anugwnudo ayeyeyi, nsaiye dəye nu zhni əmi paka baayi ga əfye. Mi kwu ɓa ka ga fye ɓa ce fye ɓəpá nabai kwa dna fye ɓənubwozhni nunui. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Mi ncei pma fya pa aɓədagbma n asheɓəgwognayi agyigyiyi ɓə da n sapai ɓədo n ɓəgbetui n əyi Dagayi n Gnyiyii ɓə ga fyi n əfye atnutnuloyi akwnu.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Tu n aɓo ye əshe vnyanya, ɓəshishinu fya ɓwa awyega nge fyi n anyipyei kpmaknai, agyekpeyi ɓə ɓe, ɓai kpeagye jesnu ɓai vyi əɓa aɓəmwi nukwoi. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Ɓa ɓə gna, “Əwo ‘ɓeɓe’ gnyi n nanu n wo ɓə shi kwo əgbe nyi a? Ənya n kwo laka shí əyi azakwoyi ɓəə fyí, nyahonyahoi znazna lo shi kwo ɓai shnisnu n anyazhnizhni ayayaba.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ama ɓa gyi əɓo fyi n əmi ɓai gwo kpe nge n əsa avnu nya, n Shekwoyi ɓədagbmai nu n a ɓə kwnu ashebmana ɓe ncei jesnu a zhni əknyi n nuwnai kwoi gbmi n nuwna. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Anuwna ye nu ɓə byi anyi əsa yi nya jesnu ɓa kwu zhniagbma. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />N ɓədagbma gbmanyigbmanyi yei nu n a kwu ashebmana nsaiye nya n əknyii fa zhi ntu əná ɓo, ncei wnaknazhi ntu n owada nyipyei ɓo ɓədo n atnashekwodnawoi agbmazhnii.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ama anugwnudo ayeyeyi fye to kwu əɓo gbmanyi ye zamwi m: N Dagayi aba nyipyei gbmanyi n wu ngye aye dugwu nu, jesnu aye dugwu ngye nyipyei gbmanyi. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Dagayi ta zhni kalala n əwo ɓəgbeshi ɓwashii m, she azaho n awyega kalala nyai nyi m. N əkwoɓwi, wo ɓwa bwugba n fyei ntuge wo to ncei pmalo zahozahoyi n fye woi ɓwu m, ama zahozahoyi wa ɓe wa yeabwi.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ama nyipyei Dagayi nya, kwo ɓə ɓe ngye əvyì nu. Ashebmana ɓə kwu ɓwuwye n əwyiɓei; əná ɓə kwu anya zhniagbma, ɓədo n əknyii n nyahonyahoi n a ɓə zhni fyi n əkwo a ɓə la kwo pmiya.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Shikwonyi a ɓə kwu nyahonyahoi zhniagbma nlai, knyi aza pya nu n fye gwo fya kwu zhni a? Fye kwnuce fya gyianyì fyi n gyigyi nu ɓədo n Shekwoyi dnawoi <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />shi fye tuwye n Shekwoyi nyipyei jesnu fya zhni kwo kwa pye n sii. Əwyii ɓə ɓe n ashebmana agbmazhnii nu n ənái, jesnu anya ɓə la wuya fyi n gwugwurugwu. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ntu əwo ɓəgbeshi ɓo, yi zhi yii tuwye n əshemi woiwoyi nu n əknyii, aba n a zhni ɓəfyece.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ntulonu anugwnudo ayeyeyi, shikwonyi ənya nyi n yi n əwyei tu lo əkwo nyi, fye la əfyehni ye ai gye fye n tnaɓənukwoi zhni, n tnaɓətu n bwugbafui n əwoi. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Fye la kwo dna n bwugba nge əyi Dagayi bwugbaɓwa zhni gnyignyi nu n əyi aba, n ɓwasnu she əyido Bwulus wo kwu ka ga fye ce n wyemwai n Shekwoyi ɓə ga wo. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Wo vyi zokwo gbmanyigbmanyi nu dna n əwo apaka vnyanya, woi da ɓa aɓo ye. Əwo apaka n aɓəhoi fyilo n ɓa dnaɓo lo n awyega ɓwa ba, ədo n atnagənyikpeyi n azai n ɓa to n myizhi lo m ɓa pmyi ɓa ɓwa ngye she ɓa zhni Anyakagyigyiyi aje nyi, ama n əɓahni agbmazhni.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Ntucenu, anugwnudo ayeyeyi, shikwonyi a la əɓo pma fye kwnu nyi, fye kwu zhigwu nabai n abaɓwi tna-owaɓwashi nya taa da fye awye m, kwo zhni fye fya kaya n əfye pwopwo aba m. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ama fye mwa fyi n shebmyashi ɓədo n yekpei əyi Dagayi n Gnyiyii Yeisu Kirisiti.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18" />
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18" />
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Latu zhni əwo nya nu ənya n kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo nyalonyalo! Aamyi.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>